  "description": "Chatham is constructed from a hand-built steel shock-absorbent frame. The durable pedals are made from hard plastic with a boron steel axel. Command your ride with Retrospec’s Swingback Bars and KT built-in coaster brake. Wanda tires grip to the path ahead and easily adapt to slick conditions, bumpy roads, and grassy straights.\n\nThe hand-built frame has a thicker top tube and is made of steel, all of which better absorb shock of the road. Wanda tires are wider to grip the road and evenly distribute weight. The wide cruiser saddle and high handlebars with cushy grips allow a relaxed ride that is easier on your back.\nChatham-1 has an extremely straightforward build. The single-speed drivetrain and foot-operated brake mean an extra sleek silhouette without any cables. There are fewer parts to this bike and therefore less need for frequent maintenance. The upgraded pedals are lightweight and extra durable with boron steel axles.\nLet a beach cruiser facilitate all of your adventures. Ride it to work. Ride it home. Ride it to class. Ride it all the places with undeniable delight.\n\n*Due to differences in screen resolutions, please note that colors may differ slightly.",
